seq v=1 rig=transcript program=claude build=2.1.0
# Twin of a_loss_in_a_steady_session_is_said_once_at_the_batchs_end (S23,
# S27): the count crosses an update; an off source counts too.
bind 0
see busy
tx prompt v1
tx flush
tx tool c0
tx tool c1
tx tool c2
tx tool c3
tx tool c4
tx tool c5
tx tool c6
tx tool c7
tx tool c8
tx flush
tx flush
tx result never-opened
tx lost 2
adopt keep-tx after=100
tx flush
state off
tx lost 0
tx lost 3
tx flush
expect mark r1 source state=on skipped=0
expect mark r1 source state=on dropped=1
expect mark r1 source dropped=4
expect mark r1 source state=off dropped=4
expect mark r1 source dropped=7 state=off
